	'messages:anonpreviewwarning' => 'hif-latn:<em>Aap log in nai bhaya hae. Ii panna ke bachae pe aap ke IP address ke panna ke badlao ke itihass me likha jaai.</em>',
	'messages:missingsummary' => 'hif-latn:<strong>Suchna:</strong> Aap badlao ke sanchhipt me nai likha hai.
Agar aap Save ke fir se click $1 karaa tab, aap ke badlao bina summary ke save kar lewa jaai.',
	'messages:selfredirect' => 'hif-latn:<strong>Chetauni:</strong> Aap ii panna ke apne me redirect kartaa hae. 
Aap saait wrong target ke specify karaa, nai to wrong panna ke badaltaa hae.
Agar aap  "$1" ke fir se click karaa tab redirect ban jaai.',
	'messages:missingcommenttext' => 'hif-latn:Meharbani kar ke aapan vichar deo.',
	'messages:missingcommentheader' => 'hif-latn:<strong>Yaad karawa jaae hae:</strong> Aap ii vichar ke vishay nai likha hai.
Agar aap "$1"  pe click karaa tab bina vishay ke iske publish kar dewa jaai.',
	'messages:summary-preview' => 'hif-latn:Sanchhep jhalak:',
	'messages:previewerrortext' => 'hif-latn:Aap ke badlao ke preview kare ke time kuchh garrbarro hae gais hai.',
	'messages:blockedtitle' => 'hif-latn:Sadasya ke rok dewa gais hai',
	'messages:blockedtext' => 'hif-latn:<strong>Aapke username nai to IP address ke rok dewa gae hai.</strong>

{{int:blockedtext-made-by|$1}}
{{int:blockedtext-reason-comment|$2}}

*{{int:blockedtext-start-time|$8}}
*{{int:blockedtext-expiration-time|$6}}
*{{int:blockedtext-intended-blockee|$7}}

{{int:blockedtext-contact-blocker-admin|$1}}
You can use the "{{int:emailuser}}" feature if a valid email address is specified in your [[Special:Preferences|preferences]] and you have not been blocked from using it.
{{int:blockedtext-block-ip|$3}} {{int:blockedtext-block-id|$5}}
{{int:blockedtext-include-details-queries}}',
	'messages:autoblockedtext' => 'hif-latn:Aap ke IP address ke apne se rok dewa gais hai kahe ki koi duusra sadasya iske kaam me kawat rahaa, jiske $1 rokis hai.

Iske khatir kaaran hai:
:<em>$2</em>

* Roke ke suruu: $8
* Roke kab khatam hoi: $6
*Roke waala: $7

Aap $1 ke mile saktaa hai nai to duusra [[{{MediaWiki:Grouppage-sysop}}|administrator]] se rukawat ke baare me baat karo.

Aap ii sadasya ke \'email this user\' feature ke kaam me lae ke baat nai kare saktaa hai jab tak ki ek kanuni email address aapke [[Special:Preferences|account preferences]] me nai hai aur aap ke iske kaam me laae ke roka nai gae hai.

Aap ke abhi ke IP address $3 hai, aur roka gae ID hai #$5.
Meharbani kar ke chahe ek nai to duno ke aapan sawaal me rakho.',
	'messages:systemblockedtext' => 'hif-latn:Aaap ke username nai to IP address ke MediaWiki automatically block kar diis hai.

Dewa gais kaaran hai :

:<em>$2</em>

* Block ke suruuwaat: $8
* Blockkab khalaas hoe hai: $6
* Intended blockee: $7

Aap ke abhi ke IP address $3 hai.
Iske baare e aur jankari maage ke time, meharbaani kar ke uppar ke sab detail bhi batanaa.',
	'messages:blockednoreason' => 'hif-latn:koi kaaran nai dewa gais hai',
	'messages:whitelistedittext' => 'hif-latn:Aap ke panna badle khatir $1 kare ke parri.',
	'messages:confirmedittext' => 'hif-latn:Panna ke badle se pahile aap ke aapan e-mail ke confirm kare ke parri.
Meharbani kar ke aap aapan e-mail ke aapan [[Special:Preferences|user preferences]] se validate karna.',
	'messages:nosuchsectiontitle' => 'hif-latn:Aisan koi bhaag nai hai',
	'messages:nosuchsectiontext' => 'hif-latn:Aap ek bhaag jon ki nai hai, ke badle ke kosis karaa hai.
Jab aap ii panna ke dekhtaa rahaa tab saait iske hatae nai to mitae dewa gais rahaa.',
	'messages:loginreqtitle' => 'hif-latn:Login Jaruri Hai',
	'messages:loginreqlink' => 'hif-latn:log in karo',
	'messages:loginreqpagetext' => 'hif-latn:Duusra panna ke dekhe ke khatir aap ke $1 kare ke parri.',
	'messages:accmailtitle' => 'hif-latn:Password bhej dewa gais hai.',
	'messages:accmailtext' => 'hif-latn:Ek randomly banawal password ke [[User talk:$1|$1]] ke khatir $2 ke lage bhaja gais hai.
Ii nawa account ke password ke \'\'[[Special:ChangePassword|change password]]\'\' panna pe badla jaae sake hai jab aap login karta hai.',
	'messages:newarticle' => 'hif-latn:(Nawaa)',
	'messages:newarticletext' => 'hif-latn:Aap ek panna ke jorr ke follow kara hae jon ki abhi nai hae.
Ii panna banae khatir, niche box me type karo (see the [$1 help page] for more info).
Agar jo aap hian par galti se aae hai tab aapan browser ke \'\'\'back\'\'\' button pe click karo.',
	'messages:anontalkpagetext' => 'hif-latn:----
<em>Ii salah kare waala panna uu anonymous sadasya ke baare me hai jon abhi account nai banais hai, nai to, account ke kaam me nai lawe hai.</em>
Ii kaaran se ham log ke IP address ke kaam me laae ke ii sadasya ke jaana jae hai.
Ii rakam ke IP address ke dher sadasya kaam me laae sake hai.
Agar aap ek anonymous user hai aur ii sochtaa hai ki bekaar baat aap ke baare me karaa gais hai, tab meharbaani kar ke
[[Special:CreateAccount|create an account]] nai to [[Special:UserLogin|log in]] aage ke garrbarri roke ke khatir aur duusra anonymous users se mistake nai kare ke khatir .',
	'messages:noarticletext' => 'hif-latn:Abhi ii panna me kuchh likhaa nai hai.
Aap saktaa hai [[Special:Search/{{PAGENAME}}|ii panna ke title khoje]] duusra panna me,
<span class="plainlinks">[{{fullurl:{{#Special:Log}}|page={{FULLPAGENAMEE}}}} search the related logs],
nai to [{{fullurl:{{FULLPAGENAME}}|action=edit}} ii panna ke badlo]</span>.',
	'messages:noarticletext-nopermission' => 'hif-latn:Abhi ii panna me koi chij likha nai hae.
Aap sakta hae [[Special:Search/{{PAGENAME}}|ii panna ke title ke khoje]] duusra panna me,
nai to <span class="plainlinks">[{{fullurl:{{#Special:Log}}|page={{FULLPAGENAMEE}}}} search the related logs]</span>, lekin aap ke ii panna ke banae ke ijaaja tnai hae.',
	'messages:missing-revision' => 'hif-latn:Panna "{{FULLPAGENAME}}" me #$1 badlao nai hae.
Iske kaaran ii hoe sake hae ki ek mitawa gais panna se link karaa jaawe hae.
Iske baare me aur jaankari [{{fullurl:{{#Special:Log}}/delete|page={{FULLPAGENAMEE}}}} deletion log] me paawa jaae sake hae.',
	'messages:userpage-userdoesnotexist' => 'hif-latn:User account "$1" abi registered nai hai.
Check karo ki Ii panna ke aap banae/badle mangta hai.',
	'messages:userpage-userdoesnotexist-view' => 'hif-latn:User account "$1" ii wiki me abhi register nai karaa gais hae',
	'messages:blocked-notice-logextract' => 'hif-latn:Ii {{GENDER:$1|sadasya}} ke abhi rok dewa gais hae.
Sab se nawaa block log entry niche dewa gais hae:',
	'messages:clearyourcache' => 'hif-latn:<strong>Note:</strong> - Save kare ke baad, aap ke sait browser ke cache ke bypass kare ke parri badlao ke dekhe khatir.
* <strong>Firefox / Safari:</strong> me <em>Shift</em> ke dabae ke <em>Reload</em/>, pe click karo, nai to chaahe <em>Ctrl-F5</em> nai to <em>Ctrl-R</em> (<em>⌘-R</em>  Mac pe)
* <strong>Google Chrome:</strong> me <em>Ctrl-Shift-R</em> dabao (<em>⌘-Shift-R</em> Mac pe)
*  <strong>Internet Explorer:</strong> me <em>Ctrl</em> dabae ke  <em>Refresh</em> pe click karo, nai to  <em>Ctrl-F5</em> dabao
* <strong>Opera:</strong> Go to <em>Menu → Settings</em> (<em>Opera → Preferences</em> on a Mac) and then to <em>Privacy & security → Clear browsing data → Cached images and files</em>.',
	'messages:usercssyoucanpreview' => 'hif-latn:\'\'\'Salah:\'\'\' Bachae se pahile "{{int:showpreview}}"  button ke kaam me laae ke aapan nawaa CSS ke test karo.',
	'messages:userjsyoucanpreview' => 'hif-latn:\'\'\'Salah:\'\'\' Bachae se pahile  "{{int:showpreview}}"  button ke kaam me laae ke aapan nawaa JavaScript ke test karo.',
	'messages:usercsspreview' => 'hif-latn:\'\'\'Yaad rakhna ki aap khali aapan CSS ke jhalak dekhta hai.
Iske abhi save nai karaa gais hai!\'\'\'',
	'messages:userjspreview' => 'hif-latn:\'\'\'Yaad rakhna ki aap khali aapan JavaScript ke testing/previewing  karta hai, iske abhi save nai karaa gais hai!\'\'\'',
	'messages:sitecsspreview' => 'hif-latn: \'\'\'Yaad rakhna ki aap ii CSS ke khaali preview kartaa hae.\'\'\'
\'\'\'Iske abhi talak bachawa nai gais hae!\'\'\'',
	'messages:sitejspreview' => 'hif-latn: \'\'\'Yaad rakhna ki aap ii JavaScript code ke khaali preview kartaa hae.\'\'\'
\'\'\'Iske abhi talak bachawa nai gais hae!\'\'\'',
	'messages:userinvalidconfigtitle' => 'hif-latn:\'\'\'Warning:\'\'\' Koi skin "$1" nai hai.
