	'messages:continue-editing' => 'hif-latn:Badle waala jagha jaao',
	'messages:previewconflict' => 'hif-latn:Ii preview uu text dekhae hai jon ki uppar ke text editing area me dekhai agar aap iske save karaa.',
	'messages:session_fail_preview' => 'hif-latn:\'\'\' Maaf karna! Ham log aap ke badlao ke process nai kare paaya hai due to a loss of session data.
Saait app ke logout kar dewa gais hai. <strong> Meharbaani kar ii verify karo ki aap logged in hai aur fir se kosis karo.</strong>
Agar ii fir bhi nai chale tab kosis karna [[Special:UserLogout|logging out]] aur fir logging back in, aur ii check karo ki browser me cookies enabled hai.',
	'messages:session_fail_preview_html' => 'hif-latn:Maaf karna! Ham log aap ke badlao ke process nai kare sakaa kahe ki session data abhi nai dekhae hai.

<em>Iske kaaran hai ki {{SITENAME}} me raw HTML enabled hai, preview ke lukae dewa gais hai as a precaution against JavaScript attacks.</em>

<strong>Agar ii kanuni badlao hai, tab fir se kosis karna.</strong>
Agar ii fir bhi kaam nai kare, tab [[Special:UserLogout|logging out]] aur logging back in ke kosis karna, aur ii check karna ki ii site ke khaatir cookies enabled hai.',
	'messages:edit_form_incomplete' => 'hif-latn:Edit form ke kuchh hissa server ke lage nai pahunche paais hae; fir se check karo ki aap ke badlao form me hae, aur fir se form ke bhejo.',
