Iske bajawa nai karaa jae sake hai.',
	'messages:readonlywarning' => 'hif-latn:<strong>Chetauni: Database ke maintenance khatir band kar dewa gais hai, tab abhi aap aapan badlao ke save nai kare paega.</strong>
