	'messages:cascadeprotectedwarning' => 'hif-latn:<strong>Chetawani:</strong> Ii panna ke band kar dewa gais jiske kaaran khaali uu sadasya jike lage [[Special:ListGroupRights|specific rights]] ke adhikaar hai iske badle sake hai , kaaheki iske niche likha gais cascade-protected {{PLURAL:$1|panna}} me rakkha gais hai:',
